-- The gift shop (the book's Area 1 map, 5A), redrawn in our pieces and turned so north is up. The
-- book's arrangement: a wedge pointing west, the door from the Hall of Paintings in its north-west
-- wall and the door from the Chamber of Ancients in its south-west wall, the stairs up against the
-- east wall in their alcove. The book's map shows no furniture: the counter, the shelves and the
-- souvenir tables follow its words. The south wall is left off: the DM's side.

